Dear Brent,

 

I would like you to represent me for the judgement.

 

I would like you to send me your prepared list of omissions, discrepancies, and grounds for appeal.

 

If you are conflicted, please can you contact the Bar and ask them to appoint someone else to draft this and represent me for the judgement process.

 

With kind wishes,

 

Nadia

 

